    {
      "children": [
        {
          "checked": true,
          "line_num": 63,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "[MANUALLY] `make patch_release` then `make release_finish` (v1.3.3); confirm Netlify deploys `master`. Shipped with v1.4.0 (2026-10-16); there is no v1.3.3 tag."
        },
        {
          "checked": true,
          "line_num": 64,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "[WE] `curl -sI https://startr.style/v1/swap.js`: 200, `max-age=31536000, immutable`, `access-control-allow-origin: *`; body sha256 equals the pin. Verified 2026-10-18: all four hold (`d93c4f09\u2026`)."
        },
        {
          "checked": true,
          "line_num": 65,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Realestate CRM `scripts/vendor_kit.py`: `SWAP_SOURCE` becomes `https://startr.style/v1/swap.js`; `make kit_fetch && make kit_check` stays green. `SWAP_SOURCE` is `/v1/swap.js` in Trellis; `make kit_fetch` not re-run, because it would drop Trellis's patched copy until the v1.1 `swap:after` fix ships."
        }
      ],
